验有效租约、文档可见性、Chunk 清单和向量完整性。", "judgement": "supported"}, {"id": "cite-2", "source_id": "src-2", "marker_index": 2, "claim": "测试答案", "evidence": {"document_id": "publish", "content_version_id": "content-publish-62776eb7eafa", "start": 90, "end": 113, "text_sha256": "5d7864d668d74a2b056aef3f5965ab208a9eb34066d3b5ac72ea0c10d10a66e1", "source_id": "src-2"}, "source_text": "所有核验与活动版本切换应在同一数据库事务完成。", "judgement": "supported"}]}, {"question_id": "q08", "question": "Embedding 和 LLM 分别接收什么演示内容？", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "测试答案[src-0][src-1][src-2]", "answer_sha256": "ea5b3059d6e23113211d69b8c90c5e01722ccb6f090518b618944d3c8cc714e5", "support_judgement": "supported", "reviewed_by": "human", "reviewed_at": "2026-11-02T07:00:00Z", "citations": [{"id": "cite-0", "source_id": "src-0", "marker_index": 0, "claim": "测试答案", "evidence": {"document_id": "outbound", "content_version_id": "content-outbound-5e20e82abacd", "start": 19, "end": 43, "text_sha256": "8084c67c65e1a0ff0601e15646138bdca5a4adfea60b365bf0124f949fd3dd8b", "source_id": "src-0"}, "source_text": "Embedding 请求发送获准的文档分段文本。", "judgement": "supported"}, {"id": "cite-1", "source_id": "src-1", "marker_index": 1, "claim": "测试答案", "evidence": {"document_id": "outbound", "content_version_id": "content-outbound-5e20e82abacd", "start": 44, "end": 66, "text_sha256": "a582cff35045947d55eab6b15c45253791eb2165947051752a5831c0bfc555f6", "source_id": "src-1"}, "source_text": "LLM 请求发送当前问题和检索到的获准片段。", "judgement": "supported"}, {"id": "cite-2", "source_id": "src-2", "marker_index": 2, "claim": "测试答案", "evidence": {"document_id": "outbound", "content_version_id": "content-outbound-5e20e82abacd", "start": 67, "end": 94, "text_sha256": "176c068b957aa6a076cb846fb0ef045b7a8e211b9207977e86c996b8878a7d30", "source_id": "src-2"}, "source_text": "演示仅使用原创合成内容，不含用户文档、密钥和个人资料。", "judgement": "supported"}]}, {"question_id": "q10", "question": "演示模型请求总期限和自动重试次数是多少，超时如何返回？", "outcome": "answered", "answer": "测试答案[src-0][src-1]", "answer_sha256"